'''Ujiyasu''' (Japanese: '''ウジヤス''') is a [[Warlord]] in [[Pokémon Conquest]].

==In the games==
[[File:Conquest Ujiyasu ending.png|thumb|right|250px|Ujiyasu fishing with [[Shingen]] and [[Kenshin]].]]
{{Spoilers}}
In {{DL|List of Pokémon Conquest stories|The Legend of Ransei}}, Ujiyasu plays a minor role as the Warlord of [[Cragspur]]. The {{player}} must defeat him, {{OBP|Kai|Conquest}}, and four other Warriors to claim the kingdom.

